{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54791","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占北斗，夜夜白霞遮。\n不过七旬兵大起，横屍千里卧如麻，忌战日西斜。\n（斗爲主，霞爲客，有索战，不可出。\n京本「有索战」作「酉未来索战」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}